<title>USA: Patriot, Doubletree to buy 3 hotels for $32 million.</title>
<headline>Patriot, Doubletree to buy 3 hotels for $32 million.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc. and Doubletree Corp. said Tuesday they agreed to buy three full-service hotels in Tallahassee and Miami, Fla., and in Chicago for a total of $32 million.</p>
<p>The hotels have a total of 750 rooms, they said.</p>
<p>Patriot and Doubletree said in August that they would invest $200 million in the next 24 months in hotel acquisitions. In each deal, Doubletree would invest 10 percent, and lease and manage the properties.</p>
</text>
